                <mxCell id="U4mly7NQItud9j2jSCEG-61" value="&lt;p&gt;Language&lt;br&gt;Go (one binary master, one binary worker)&lt;br&gt;Data plane&lt;br&gt;Apache Arrow (Go) — internal format (RecordBatch)&lt;br&gt;Parquet (Arrow Parquet writer) — output files&lt;br&gt;Source (any DB)&lt;br&gt;ADBC as the main unified interface (SQL → Arrow)&lt;br&gt;Fallback drivers (only where ADBC is unavailable/raw):&lt;br&gt;Oracle: godror (ODPI-C)&lt;br&gt;Postgres: pgx&lt;br&gt;MySQL: go-mysql driver&lt;br&gt;MSSQL: go-mssqldb&lt;br&gt;Target&lt;br&gt;S3 / MinIO (AWS SDK v2, multipart upload)&lt;br&gt;Iceberg Catalog (REST catalog client; one committer per master)&lt;br&gt;Management&lt;br&gt;SQLite (only on master, WAL mode) — jobs/runs/tasks/connections/events/HWM&lt;br&gt;gRPC (master ↔ workers)&lt;br&gt;HTTP + SSE (user/web UI ↔ master)&lt;br&gt;Security of secrets&lt;br&gt;SQLite stores connection metadata + encrypted secret blob&lt;br&gt;the encryption key is only in env on master (MASTER_ENC_KEY)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-775" y="-450" width="425" height="450" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
